# TCLS r1: FX is a surviving setup page, not an X0X pattern page. SAVE + a white key used to paste
# the pattern here ("P1 PASTED TO P3": ACT_COPY on the dead scratch pattern, mark_dirty). It must do
# nothing now: the project stays clean and no pattern state moves.
wait 300
tap FX
expect view 3
expect pattern 1
expect cue 0
expect lanes 0
expect dirty 0
press SAVE
tapkey w2
expect dirty 0                 # the paste would have marked the project dirty
expect pattern 1
expect cue 0
expect lanes 0
release SAVE
expect pattern 1
expect cue 0
expect lanes 0
dump fx_save_paste.json
